ISO-10303-21;
/* Pmi157: CIRCULAR_RUNOUT_TOLERANCE with no datum-system / datum-reference — runout requires a datum axis; datum-less runout FCF is GD&T-illegal; compliant reader must reject/warn, not silently accept; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC loads the point as one vertex */
